{"cue_index": 0, "page": 1, "text": "And her ambition was to extend her realm... to all the regions of the known world.", "start": 160.31, "end": 166.81, "score": 0.865}
{"cue_index": 1, "page": 1, "text": "To this end, she gathered an army.", "start": 167.15, "end": 175.19, "score": 0.473}
{"cue_index": 2, "page": 1, "text": "And she bore a son, and named him Nekron.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 3, "page": 1, "text": "And him she tutored in the black arts and in the powers of the mind.", "start": 175.19, "end": 182.51, "score": 0.592}
{"cue_index": 4, "page": 1, "text": "And when Nekron came of age... and attained mastery of those powers... together they seized control of the region of Ice.", "start": 182.51, "end": 188.51, "score": 0.71}
{"cue_index": 5, "page": 1, "text": "And from their castle called Ice Peak... they sent a giant glacier rumbling southward.", "start": 188.83, "end": 194.69, "score": 0.886}
{"cue_index": 6, "page": 1, "text": "No village or people could stand against its relentless onslaught.", "start": 194.69, "end": 200.63, "score": 0.744}
{"cue_index": 7, "page": 1, "text": "And so the remnants of humanity fled south... and huddled for warmth among the volcanoes... of a mountain region ruled by a generous king named Jarol... from his fortress, which men called Fire Keep.", "start": 200.63, "end": 207.67, "score": 0.519}
{"cue_index": 8, "page": 1, "text": "And still Nekron pushed the Ice ever southward... into the temperate zone toward Fire Keep.", "start": 215.37, "end": 223.33, "score": 0.71}
{"cue_index": 9, "page": 1, "text": "And no one dared guess at the outcome... of a meeting on the field of battle... between Fire and Ice.", "start": 223.33, "end": 231.49, "score": 0.834}
{"cue_index": 10, "page": 1, "text": "Hold your positions, men. Steady.", "start": 231.85, "end": 284.24, "score": 0.536}
{"cue_index": 11, "page": 1, "text": "Larn, it cannot be stopped.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 12, "page": 1, "text": "Join your brother.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 13, "page": 1, "text": "You have done well, my son.", "start": 284.42, "end": 421.0, "score": 0.594}
{"cue_index": 14, "page": 1, "text": "The North Village has fallen. We have won.", "start": 421.14, "end": 422.44, "score": 0.41}
{"cue_index": 15, "page": 1, "text": "I want to thank you, Mother.", "start": 423.12, "end": 424.92, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 16, "page": 1, "text": "The Great Plain is all that stands between ourselves and Fire Keep.", "start": 425.78, "end": 429.98, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 17, "page": 1, "text": "That is a long distance.", "start": 430.58, "end": 432.44, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 18, "page": 1, "text": "A distance we may not have to travel.", "start": 433.28, "end": 440.3, "score": 0.524}
{"cue_index": 19, "page": 1, "text": "I am sending our envoys to Jarol with our new demands.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 20, "page": 1, "text": "He will not submit.", "start": 440.88, "end": 442.44, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 21, "page": 2, "text": "Perhaps.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 22, "page": 2, "text": "You will present our demands to King Jarol at Fire Keep and... give our royal regards to his lovely daughter.", "start": 442.72, "end": 449.32, "score": 0.558}
{"cue_index": 23, "page": 2, "text": "But, Father, I want to be with you when you meet Nekron's men.", "start": 451.14, "end": 778.58, "score": 0.639}
{"cue_index": 24, "page": 2, "text": "You will serve your people better here with your studies, my daughter.", "start": 778.9, "end": 782.76, "score": 0.881}
{"cue_index": 25, "page": 2, "text": "Give me your love.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 26, "page": 2, "text": "You have it always, Father.", "start": 783.38, "end": 787.41, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 27, "page": 2, "text": "All matter in our world is from the natural bases... which are earth, air, fire and water... the four elements from which all things are created.", "start": 787.75, "end": 809.02, "score": 0.63}
{"cue_index": 28, "page": 2, "text": "How can you talk about elements when the war draws nearer to us every hour?", "start": 815.89, "end": 820.21, "score": 0.931}
{"cue_index": 29, "page": 2, "text": "Princess Teegra, we all have our duty.", "start": 821.29, "end": 826.97, "score": 0.462}
{"cue_index": 30, "page": 2, "text": "Your father's duty is to be king and lead.", "start": 826.97, "end": 831.97, "score": 0.529}
{"cue_index": 31, "page": 2, "text": "Your brother's duty is to soldier.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 32, "page": 2, "text": "And your duty is to learn.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 33, "page": 2, "text": "You mean my duty is to stay shut up... while all the men do the fighting and share all the glory.", "start": 832.63, "end": 838.61, "score": 0.887}
{"cue_index": 34, "page": 2, "text": "We think that stinks.", "start": 840.55, "end": 845.78, "score": 0.563}
{"cue_index": 35, "page": 2, "text": "Don't we, Shaitan?", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 36, "page": 2, "text": "If you peacefully surrender, my lord Nekron will cease the destruction of This is your message of peace?", "start": 846.38, "end": 850.5, "score": 0.663}
{"cue_index": 37, "page": 2, "text": "A demand for our total and unconditional surrender?", "start": 850.5, "end": 854.38, "score": 0.669}
{"cue_index": 38, "page": 2, "text": "We call it an offer of alliance, Your Majesty.", "start": 855.3, "end": 858.4, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 39, "page": 2, "text": "I call it blackmail.", "start": 858.4, "end": 860.24, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 40, "page": 2, "text": "My lord Nekron's offer To hell with Nekron and his offer.", "start": 862.88, "end": 866.7, "score": 0.442}
{"cue_index": 41, "page": 2, "text": "We are free men, not slaves.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 42, "page": 2, "text": "King Jarol, be reasonable.", "start": 868.54, "end": 870.42, "score": 0.79}
{"cue_index": 43, "page": 2, "text": "My son, Taro, speaks more with his heart than with his head.", "start": 871.6, "end": 876.6, "score": 0.579}
{"cue_index": 44, "page": 2, "text": "But he speaks for all of us.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 45, "page": 2, "text": "There can be no alliance.", "start": 876.92, "end": 880.46, "score": 0.513}
{"cue_index": 46, "page": 2, "text": "We will fight you to the death.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 47, "page": 2, "text": "Perhaps, you will soon change your mind.", "start": 882.68, "end": 885.5, "score": 0.869}
{"cue_index": 48, "page": 3, "text": "No!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 49, "page": 3, "text": "Teegra!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 50, "page": 3, "text": "Guards!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 51, "page": 3, "text": "Make for the glacier. Man the Dragonhawks.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 52, "page": 3, "text": "Hurry!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 53, "page": 3, "text": "The Dragonhawks will find her, Father.", "start": 1009.15, "end": 1010.41, "score": 0.889}
{"cue_index": 54, "page": 3, "text": "They've got to.", "start": 1010.41, "end": 1011.65, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 55, "page": 3, "text": "The night's so dark, the jungle so thick.", "start": 1012.71, "end": 1017.51, "score": 0.397}
{"cue_index": 56, "page": 3, "text": "A bird couldn't find its own nest.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 57, "page": 3, "text": "What do we do then, Father?", "start": 1019.98, "end": 1021.66, "score": 0.867}
{"cue_index": 58, "page": 3, "text": "We wait.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 59, "page": 3, "text": "For Nekron's new demands?", "start": 1024.27, "end": 1025.73, "score": 0.78}
{"cue_index": 60, "page": 3, "text": "For his siege!", "start": 1026.17, "end": 1027.37, "score": 0.714}
{"cue_index": 61, "page": 3, "text": "What is your report?", "start": 1108.64, "end": 1547.42, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 62, "page": 3, "text": "Have you done as I commanded?", "start": 1548.14, "end": 1550.0, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 63, "page": 3, "text": "Have you captured the girl, Teegra, Jarol's daughter?", "start": 1550.78, "end": 1553.98, "score": 0.703}
{"cue_index": 64, "page": 3, "text": "Where is she?", "start": 1554.4, "end": 1556.16, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 65, "page": 3, "text": "Bring her forth that I may see her.", "start": 1557.18, "end": 1559.54, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 66, "page": 3, "text": "Gone.", "start": 1562.84, "end": 1563.32, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 67, "page": 3, "text": "Gone?", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 68, "page": 3, "text": "Gone!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 69, "page": 3, "text": "Escaped? You filth-spawned scum!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 70, "page": 3, "text": "What punishment does failure demand?", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 71, "page": 3, "text": "Death.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 72, "page": 3, "text": "Find the girl.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 73, "page": 3, "text": "Find her, or his punishment shall be yours.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 74, "page": 3, "text": "Gods of my father.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 75, "page": 3, "text": "What do you want?", "start": 1563.8, "end": 1875.26, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 76, "page": 3, "text": "If you want it, take it.", "start": 1875.4, "end": 1891.82, "score": 0.873}
{"cue_index": 77, "page": 3, "text": "I am not a thief.", "start": 1892.0, "end": 1898.78, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 78, "page": 3, "text": "Not so close, you'll burn it.", "start": 1899.1, "end": 2001.47, "score": 0.84}
{"cue_index": 79, "page": 3, "text": "I've always lived close to a fire.", "start": 2002.27, "end": 2009.99, "score": 0.62}
{"cue_index": 80, "page": 3, "text": "Sometimes in the night, I'm so afraid.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 81, "page": 3, "text": "It's getting colder.", "start": 2010.75, "end": 2031.82, "score": 0.614}
{"cue_index": 82, "page": 3, "text": "Cold comes from Nekron.", "start": 2032.26, "end": 2044.22, "score": 0.615}
{"cue_index": 83, "page": 3, "text": "I know.", "start": 2045.02, "end": 2045.66, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 84, "page": 3, "text": "Where are you going?", "start": 2045.96, "end": 2058.42, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 85, "page": 3, "text": "I'm going home to my people.", "start": 2058.72, "end": 2060.1, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 86, "page": 3, "text": "Where is home?", "start": 2064.17, "end": 2064.83, "score": 0.569}
{"cue_index": 87, "page": 3, "text": "Far away, to the south.", "start": 2065.09, "end": 2066.65, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 88, "page": 3, "text": "I'm going south, too.", "start": 2067.41, "end": 2068.61, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 89, "page": 3, "text": "Yeah?", "start": 2069.25, "end": 2069.73, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 90, "page": 3, "text": "You can come along if you behave yourself.", "start": 2071.41, "end": 2073.05, "score": 0.64}
{"cue_index": 91, "page": 4, "text": "If I behave myself?", "start": 2073.47, "end": 2074.77, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 92, "page": 4, "text": "No.", "start": 2078.83, "end": 2079.35, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 93, "page": 4, "text": "Larn.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 94, "page": 4, "text": "You've caught me, but you'll never hand me over to Nekron.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 95, "page": 4, "text": "You'll have to kill me first.", "start": 2080.15, "end": 2237.47, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 96, "page": 4, "text": "Don't hunt for death, boy.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 97, "page": 4, "text": "It finds us all soon enough.", "start": 2237.73, "end": 2247.79, "score": 0.722}
{"cue_index": 98, "page": 4, "text": "The travois was to keep you from killing yourself till you're all healed.", "start": 2248.09, "end": 2256.16, "score": 0.566}
{"cue_index": 99, "page": 4, "text": "You need rest and food.", "start": 2259.24, "end": 2260.34, "score": 0.545}
{"cue_index": 100, "page": 4, "text": "If you're gonna kill the Ice Lord, boy, you better learn to live with pain.", "start": 2270.19, "end": 2272.15, "score": 0.552}
{"cue_index": 101, "page": 4, "text": "Ice Lord? You mean you're fighting Nekron?", "start": 2277.16, "end": 2278.8, "score": 0.669}
{"cue_index": 102, "page": 4, "text": "Him and his mother.", "start": 2279.54, "end": 2284.46, "score": 0.685}
{"cue_index": 103, "page": 4, "text": "That wolf bitch, Juliana.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 104, "page": 4, "text": "Teegra!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 105, "page": 4, "text": "They were here.", "start": 2284.8, "end": 2301.88, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 106, "page": 4, "text": "Nekron's dogs, they got the girl.", "start": 2303.42, "end": 2305.1, "score": 0.72}
{"cue_index": 107, "page": 4, "text": "They took her west.", "start": 2306.54, "end": 2307.68, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 108, "page": 4, "text": "Guard Teegra.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 109, "page": 4, "text": "They camped less than two miles from here.", "start": 2308.08, "end": 2363.55, "score": 0.877}
{"cue_index": 110, "page": 4, "text": "Come.", "start": 2363.97, "end": 2364.49, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 111, "page": 4, "text": "I saw the girl before.", "start": 2386.76, "end": 2514.9, "score": 0.721}
{"cue_index": 112, "page": 4, "text": "She is on the far side of the big tree.", "start": 2515.3, "end": 2517.18, "score": 0.831}
{"cue_index": 113, "page": 4, "text": "You go get her out, and I'll distract the others.", "start": 2518.46, "end": 2521.26, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 114, "page": 4, "text": "There must be 50 of them.", "start": 2521.7, "end": 2523.14, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 115, "page": 4, "text": "That sounds about right.", "start": 2524.14, "end": 2525.72, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 116, "page": 4, "text": "Where's the girl?", "start": 2612.64, "end": 2613.44, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 117, "page": 4, "text": "I couldn't find her.", "start": 2613.54, "end": 2614.04, "score": 0.367}
{"cue_index": 118, "page": 4, "text": "No!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 119, "page": 4, "text": "The horses!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 120, "page": 4, "text": "No, they'd be on our heels before we could reach them.", "start": 2643.23, "end": 2645.01, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 121, "page": 4, "text": "But Teegra's still back there.", "start": 2645.39, "end": 2647.01, "score": 0.808}
{"cue_index": 122, "page": 4, "text": "Then we'll come back for her.", "start": 2647.09, "end": 2648.27, "score": 0.813}
{"cue_index": 123, "page": 4, "text": "First, we lead the Nekron's dogs on a wild chase.", "start": 2648.77, "end": 2651.07, "score": 0.899}
{"cue_index": 124, "page": 4, "text": "Come.", "start": 2651.53, "end": 2651.93, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 125, "page": 4, "text": "We'll take our stand up there. Come.", "start": 2652.33, "end": 2706.1, "score": 0.883}
{"cue_index": 126, "page": 4, "text": "Enough!", "start": 2714.44, "end": 2714.84, "score": 0.429}
{"cue_index": 127, "page": 4, "text": "I want you to go to Nekron, to his mother, Juliana.", "start": 2715.96, "end": 2718.64, "score": 0.83}
{"cue_index": 128, "page": 5, "text": "We must negotiate.", "start": 2720.42, "end": 2721.4, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 129, "page": 5, "text": "With the enemy?", "start": 2721.76, "end": 2722.54, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 130, "page": 5, "text": "No man is wholly evil.", "start": 2723.66, "end": 2725.3, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 131, "page": 5, "text": "Surely there is some way to appeal to Nekron.", "start": 2725.36, "end": 2727.4, "score": 0.878}
{"cue_index": 132, "page": 5, "text": "You expect his mercy?", "start": 2727.62, "end": 2728.82, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 133, "page": 5, "text": "Father, do you know what he will do if I enter his land under a flag of truce?", "start": 2731.64, "end": 2734.38, "score": 0.838}
{"cue_index": 134, "page": 5, "text": "We have no choice!", "start": 2734.56, "end": 2735.64, "score": 0.772}
{"cue_index": 135, "page": 5, "text": "We must take that risk.", "start": 2736.44, "end": 2737.7, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 136, "page": 5, "text": "You must take that risk, my son, for the sake of Fire Keep.", "start": 2737.78, "end": 2739.22, "score": 0.566}
{"cue_index": 137, "page": 5, "text": "For the sake of your sister.", "start": 2742.26, "end": 2743.6, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 138, "page": 5, "text": "Go, ride swiftly.", "start": 2747.7, "end": 2748.48, "score": 0.767}
{"cue_index": 139, "page": 5, "text": "Welcome to my hearth.", "start": 2774.88, "end": 2776.32, "score": 0.788}
{"cue_index": 140, "page": 5, "text": "I am Roliel and these woods are my home.", "start": 2776.76, "end": 2779.94, "score": 0.876}
{"cue_index": 141, "page": 5, "text": "You've had a trying journey.", "start": 2780.68, "end": 2783.2, "score": 0.883}
{"cue_index": 142, "page": 5, "text": "Please let me give you some food and drink.", "start": 2784.58, "end": 2786.82, "score": 0.894}
{"cue_index": 143, "page": 5, "text": "First, you shall rest. Then we will talk.", "start": 2787.44, "end": 2788.58, "score": 0.599}
{"cue_index": 144, "page": 5, "text": "Poor, poor darling.", "start": 2791.95, "end": 2793.55, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 145, "page": 5, "text": "Did Great Otwa frighten you?", "start": 2794.09, "end": 2797.27, "score": 0.487}
{"cue_index": 146, "page": 5, "text": "You mustn't be afraid.", "start": 2797.65, "end": 2799.37, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 147, "page": 5, "text": "He's as gentle as a child.", "start": 2799.91, "end": 2801.89, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 148, "page": 5, "text": "I saw him twist a chain apart with his bare hands.", "start": 2808.67, "end": 2811.25, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 149, "page": 5, "text": "Yes, he is strong, my sweet.", "start": 2811.51, "end": 2814.19, "score": 0.895}
{"cue_index": 150, "page": 5, "text": "But he means well, my darling.", "start": 2815.37, "end": 2817.43, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 151, "page": 5, "text": "He brought you to me, did he not?", "start": 2817.55, "end": 2819.31, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 152, "page": 5, "text": "I'm so tired.", "start": 2826.2, "end": 2827.56, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 153, "page": 5, "text": "Yes, my poor, poor darling.", "start": 2827.84, "end": 2831.12, "score": 0.882}
{"cue_index": 154, "page": 5, "text": "Yes, you're so tired... and so beautiful.", "start": 2832.56, "end": 2866.72, "score": 0.455}
{"cue_index": 155, "page": 5, "text": "You must... Tell me your secrets.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 156, "page": 5, "text": "Nekron?", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 157, "page": 5, "text": "The girl is wanted by Nekron? The bitch!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 158, "page": 5, "text": "She brings danger into my house!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 159, "page": 5, "text": "Perhaps I can turn this to my advantage.", "start": 2885.15, "end": 2887.65, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 160, "page": 5, "text": "Otwa, my son.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 161, "page": 5, "text": "Go and bring the subhumans, Nekron's dogs.", "start": 2889.84, "end": 2895.78, "score": 0.683}
{"cue_index": 162, "page": 5, "text": "Tell them we have the girl that he wants.", "start": 2896.28, "end": 2898.64, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 163, "page": 5, "text": "Tell them he can have her, for a price.", "start": 2901.04, "end": 2904.28, "score": 0.894}
{"cue_index": 164, "page": 5, "text": "Kill.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 165, "page": 6, "text": "Get out of here.", "start": 2934.62, "end": 2940.33, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 166, "page": 6, "text": "No.", "start": 2940.89, "end": 2940.93, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 167, "page": 6, "text": "The hell you won't.", "start": 2941.97, "end": 2943.41, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 168, "page": 6, "text": "Go find the girl.", "start": 2943.41, "end": 2944.53, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 169, "page": 6, "text": "Enter, my son. It is not barred.", "start": 2974.71, "end": 2983.82, "score": 0.859}
{"cue_index": 170, "page": 6, "text": "What's wrong with you?", "start": 2984.02, "end": 2990.63, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 171, "page": 6, "text": "Where are the dogs?", "start": 2990.69, "end": 2991.67, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 172, "page": 6, "text": "You would do this Why do the living... disturb the sleep of the dead?", "start": 3020.92, "end": 3061.3, "score": 0.702}
{"cue_index": 173, "page": 6, "text": "I followed a trail. I seek a girl, Teegra.", "start": 3064.8, "end": 3067.12, "score": 0.438}
{"cue_index": 174, "page": 6, "text": "A girl?", "start": 3069.02, "end": 3070.16, "score": 0.595}
{"cue_index": 175, "page": 6, "text": "Yes. She did this to me.", "start": 3072.88, "end": 3075.56, "score": 0.859}
{"cue_index": 176, "page": 6, "text": "She and Nekron.", "start": 3076.14, "end": 3082.73, "score": 0.492}
{"cue_index": 177, "page": 6, "text": "Cursed Nekron.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 178, "page": 6, "text": "Where can I find her?", "start": 3082.73, "end": 3084.89, "score": 0.479}
{"cue_index": 179, "page": 6, "text": "Why should I answer?", "start": 3088.23, "end": 3089.67, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 180, "page": 6, "text": "For revenge against Nekron.", "start": 3090.15, "end": 3092.47, "score": 0.781}
{"cue_index": 181, "page": 6, "text": "Nekron?", "start": 3096.72, "end": 3097.48, "score": 0.357}
{"cue_index": 182, "page": 6, "text": "Akatar. They take her to Akatar.", "start": 3097.84, "end": 3102.94, "score": 0.726}
{"cue_index": 183, "page": 6, "text": "And from there to the Icy King's realm.", "start": 3103.38, "end": 3106.38, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 184, "page": 6, "text": "Avenge me.", "start": 3107.8, "end": 3108.76, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 185, "page": 6, "text": "Avenge me!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 186, "page": 6, "text": "Akatar.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 187, "page": 6, "text": "Teegra!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 188, "page": 6, "text": "My Prince, all is arranged.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 189, "page": 6, "text": "I've hired a ship. It waits for us at the dock.", "start": 3157.4, "end": 3163.92, "score": 0.63}
{"cue_index": 190, "page": 6, "text": "Nekron waits at Ice Peak.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 191, "page": 6, "text": "Get the gangplanks aboard.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 192, "page": 6, "text": "Move, you scum!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 193, "page": 6, "text": "We must be well on our way before sunrise.", "start": 3164.3, "end": 3177.15, "score": 0.808}
{"cue_index": 194, "page": 6, "text": "Why have you brought me this?", "start": 3177.97, "end": 3192.96, "score": 0.739}
{"cue_index": 195, "page": 6, "text": "This is your bride, my son.", "start": 3196.29, "end": 3203.2, "score": 0.56}
{"cue_index": 196, "page": 6, "text": "She will be mother to your sons.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 197, "page": 6, "text": "How thoughtful, Mother.", "start": 3203.42, "end": 3210.54, "score": 0.473}
{"cue_index": 198, "page": 6, "text": "I need no bride, and no sons.", "start": 3213.3, "end": 3215.1, "score": 0.416}
{"cue_index": 199, "page": 6, "text": "But you need heirs.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 200, "page": 6, "text": "I need nothing!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 201, "page": 6, "text": "Nekron?", "start": 3251.82, "end": 3252.34, "score": 0.357}
{"cue_index": 202, "page": 6, "text": "Nekron, you're a great power in the world.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 203, "page": 6, "text": "You have all that any man ever wants or needed.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 204, "page": 6, "text": "And yet you despair.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 205, "page": 6, "text": "For there is one thing you lack.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 206, "page": 7, "text": "One gift that only you can bestow between our people.", "start": 3255.6, "end": 3258.28, "score": 0.418}
{"cue_index": 207, "page": 7, "text": "Peace.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 208, "page": 7, "text": "This is the gift that heals the heart of the giver.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 209, "page": 7, "text": "Nekron, I extend my hand in friendship.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 210, "page": 7, "text": "I offer peace between our people.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 211, "page": 7, "text": "Will you not take my hand?", "start": 3259.22, "end": 3260.58, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 212, "page": 7, "text": "Will you not call me friend?", "start": 3265.44, "end": 3266.72, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 213, "page": 7, "text": "Woman... I spit on peace.", "start": 3303.92, "end": 3316.38, "score": 0.584}
{"cue_index": 214, "page": 7, "text": "I spit on you.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 215, "page": 7, "text": "Next time you present me with one of your little sluts, Mother dear... I'll squash you like a bug.", "start": 3323.19, "end": 3325.93, "score": 0.667}
{"cue_index": 216, "page": 7, "text": "Get that garbage out of here.", "start": 3329.15, "end": 3335.27, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 217, "page": 7, "text": "Don't look up.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 218, "page": 7, "text": "We are riders of Fire Keep.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 219, "page": 7, "text": "We pay no heed to such trash.", "start": 3335.53, "end": 3395.53, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 220, "page": 7, "text": "We have come, Lord Nekron, to negotiate between our two peoples.", "start": 3471.57, "end": 3476.53, "score": 0.909}
{"cue_index": 221, "page": 7, "text": "And the return to Fire Keep of my sister, Teegra... whom your warriors basely kidnapped.", "start": 3476.67, "end": 3482.17, "score": 0.859}
{"cue_index": 222, "page": 7, "text": "My father, King Jarol, has empowered me... to offer a peace between our kingdoms... in exchange for his continued sovereignty... and my sister's freedom.", "start": 3482.37, "end": 3489.11, "score": 0.542}
{"cue_index": 223, "page": 7, "text": "It seems to me that my envoys made a similar offer not long since... and that it was spurned by your illustrious sire.", "start": 3495.83, "end": 3500.57, "score": 0.654}
{"cue_index": 224, "page": 7, "text": "You know full well, Nekron, that offer was made... before your minions kidnapped my sister.", "start": 3505.61, "end": 3510.19, "score": 0.868}
{"cue_index": 225, "page": 7, "text": "I fear, Good Prince, I cannot offer peace to a people... who have refused to proclaim me their rightful overlord.", "start": 3510.47, "end": 3517.77, "score": 0.941}
{"cue_index": 226, "page": 7, "text": "As to your sister... I must admit that until this moment... the idea of mating with her filled me with loathing.", "start": 3524.02, "end": 3530.72, "score": 0.776}
{"cue_index": 227, "page": 7, "text": "Perhaps I should reconsider.", "start": 3531.04, "end": 3532.8, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 228, "page": 8, "text": "Your sister, after all, is not wholly unattractive.", "start": 3534.18, "end": 3538.12, "score": 0.822}
{"cue_index": 229, "page": 8, "text": "As lesser beasts go.", "start": 3539.38, "end": 3541.2, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 230, "page": 8, "text": "Pig you are.", "start": 3564.18, "end": 3673.03, "score": 0.35}
{"cue_index": 231, "page": 8, "text": "And like a pig shall you die.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 232, "page": 8, "text": "No!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 233, "page": 8, "text": "No, I don't think so.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 234, "page": 8, "text": "You interest me.", "start": 3685.44, "end": 3698.89, "score": 0.354}
{"cue_index": 235, "page": 8, "text": "Guards!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 236, "page": 8, "text": "Bring him to me.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 237, "page": 8, "text": "Release him.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 238, "page": 8, "text": "Why have you come seeking me?", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 239, "page": 8, "text": "You killed my people.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 240, "page": 8, "text": "We've had to dispose of so many undesirables of late.", "start": 3699.53, "end": 3702.99, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 241, "page": 8, "text": "Let him rest. There is still fight in him.", "start": 3704.43, "end": 3795.8, "score": 0.452}
{"cue_index": 242, "page": 8, "text": "Larn.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 243, "page": 8, "text": "Teegra, is that you?", "start": 3796.1, "end": 3858.87, "score": 0.75}
{"cue_index": 244, "page": 8, "text": "Teegra, are you all right?", "start": 3860.81, "end": 3861.79, "score": 0.804}
{"cue_index": 245, "page": 8, "text": "Yes. I'm trying to unlock the door.", "start": 3861.97, "end": 3863.65, "score": 0.861}
{"cue_index": 246, "page": 8, "text": "Never mind the door, you've to get out of here.", "start": 3863.85, "end": 3865.37, "score": 0.844}
{"cue_index": 247, "page": 8, "text": "I'm not leaving without you.", "start": 3865.51, "end": 3868.17, "score": 0.53}
{"cue_index": 248, "page": 8, "text": "Maybe I can get a key somehow.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 249, "page": 8, "text": "No, Teegra, don't.", "start": 3868.59, "end": 3869.75, "score": 0.529}
{"cue_index": 250, "page": 8, "text": "Is he certain?", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 251, "page": 8, "text": "It was my son you saw?", "start": 3880.67, "end": 4041.23, "score": 0.834}
{"cue_index": 252, "page": 8, "text": "They called him Prince Taro.", "start": 4041.51, "end": 4043.7, "score": 0.5}
{"cue_index": 253, "page": 8, "text": "He died.", "start": 4044.7, "end": 4045.54, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 254, "page": 8, "text": "What about Teegra?", "start": 4045.54, "end": 4049.25, "score": 0.61}
{"cue_index": 255, "page": 8, "text": "He's got her, too.", "start": 4050.39, "end": 4051.55, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 256, "page": 8, "text": "Maybe she's still alive.", "start": 4051.71, "end": 4052.95, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 257, "page": 8, "text": "It's a chance.", "start": 4053.61, "end": 4054.61, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 258, "page": 8, "text": "Believe what you want, but that glacier is a fact.", "start": 4056.73, "end": 4058.49, "score": 0.511}
{"cue_index": 259, "page": 8, "text": "For three days and nights it's been pushing south.", "start": 4061.2, "end": 4064.06, "score": 0.895}
{"cue_index": 260, "page": 8, "text": "A thousand souls lost because of Nekron's rage.", "start": 4064.64, "end": 4068.18, "score": 0.878}
{"cue_index": 261, "page": 8, "text": "Fire Keep is next. We must attack.", "start": 4070.74, "end": 4072.0, "score": 0.52}
{"cue_index": 262, "page": 8, "text": "I need the Dragonhawks.", "start": 4072.34, "end": 4074.18, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 263, "page": 8, "text": "The Dragonhawks are too few.", "start": 4074.44, "end": 4076.18, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 264, "page": 8, "text": "Enough to get in with.", "start": 4076.52, "end": 4077.96, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 265, "page": 8, "text": "One us might get through and destroy him.", "start": 4078.18, "end": 4079.72, "score": 0.562}
{"cue_index": 266, "page": 9, "text": "But if that glacier passes beyond the river, I will have no choice.", "start": 4082.58, "end": 4084.66, "score": 0.704}
{"cue_index": 267, "page": 9, "text": "I will have to release the lava.", "start": 4087.04, "end": 4088.58, "score": 1.0}
{"cue_index": 268, "page": 9, "text": "Teegra.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 269, "page": 9, "text": "Larn.", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 270, "page": 9, "text": "Nekron!", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 271, "page": 9, "text": "Die! Die! Why don't you die?", "start": 4088.86, "end": 4636.45, "score": 0.408}
{"cue_index": 272, "page": 9, "text": "No, Larn! No, it's over, don't you see?", "start": null, "end": null, "score": 0.0}
{"cue_index": 273, "page": 9, "text": "We have to start over.", "start": 4637.01, "end": 4638.33, "score": 1.0}